WEBVTT

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.660
Who do the crowds say I am?

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.340
Some say that You are John the Baptist,

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.080
others say that You are Elijah,

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:32.680
while others say that one of the prophets of long ago

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.990
has come back to life.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.780
What about you?

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:39.350
Who do you say I am?

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.700
You are God's Messiah.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.370
You shall tell no man of this.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.810
The Son of Man must suffer much and be rejected.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:01.850
He will be put to death,

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:06.680
but three days later will be raised to life.

